        },
        "texto": "See also Luke 52:17. The grain in the East is threshed in the open air (see note on Gen. 50:10 #90) by being trampled under the feet of oxen or horses (see note on Deut. 25:4) or by means of instruments, as described in the note on Isaiah 28:27-28 (#508). By these processes the s…"
